ntent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499620860_1629465891368151_7596993720465277411_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=eRgXzXxFIgIQ7kNvwEQgyQM&_nc_oc=AdpCbDTRNuzSA8PCkUDo6hebOJU5TDddiCRTVB92PH4QE61AChiGKp-YAU19WczAqj0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af07CQFuUSxilQyfb7JwUXkOCOqrvGbT4yWpZVXdDPrNww&oe=69DB9960"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "BoomBox Remastered", "keywords": ["fitness", "social", "dancing", "pets", "rhythm"], "long_description": "BoomBox is back!!! Remastered. Remixed. Reborn with sweat, soul, and a heartbeat you can feel through your controllers.\n\nBoomBox lets you drum, move, and turn your energy into rhythm inside vibrant worlds that react to every beat. And here\u2019s the difference: BoomBox isn\u2019t just a rhythm game  -  it\u2019s a rhythm community. Every custom song, every map, every wild idea lives inside the game, created and shared effortlessly by real players. No mods, no file hunting, no barriers.\n\nWhether you're pushing through a sweaty workout, chasing that perfect combo, or crafting your own tracks, BoomBox gives you the tools, the freedom, and the beat.\n\nYou\u2019re not just playing. You\u2019re part of it.\n\n**Key Features**\n\n\ud83c\udfb5 **In-Game Custom Songs**: access hundreds of community-made maps directly from the game. No mods.\n\n\ud83e\udd41 **Real Drumming Gameplay**: grab virtual sticks and feel like you\u2019re behind a futuristic drum kit blasting beats to life.\n\n\u2728 **Stunning Immersive Environments**: drum in Japanese gardens, ancient ruins, magical skies, and beyond.\n\n\ud83d\udcaa **Fitness Mode That Actually Works**: built for movement, sweat, rhythm, and progression. Feel it the next morning.\n\n\ud83c\udfa8 **Easy Map Editor**: create, share, and play your own maps.\n\n\ud83d\udc65 **Community-Powered Updates**: we build BoomBox with our players. Every update shaped by real feedback and real passion.\n\n\ud83d\ude3b **Don't forget to pet Pupa** - your companion pet.", "short_description": "BoomBox is back, Remastered with heart, sweat, and a whole lot of beat. Drum your way through endless maps in breathtaking environments, where every community-created song is available right inside the game. This is rhythm, fitness, and pure expression in one place, shaped by a passionate community that drives every update. More music, more movement, more you. Grab your sticks, feel the pulse, and help build the game we all dream of."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.boomboxvr.com/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Cyberspline Games Inc.", "support_website_url": "https://discord.gg/mAJGqGq4nN", "website_url": "https://www.boomboxvr.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1672577396871977"}, {"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "1592192974313489"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER", "CO_OP", "SINGLE_USER"], "id": "25097508059844934"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 2, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1403740161768040"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "2054594182008536"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "2054594182008536"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1776445200, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1403740161768040"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_r